WEBVTT

00:07:28.486 --> 00:07:30.446
In a word,

00:07:30.446 --> 00:07:32.323
deficits.

00:07:32.323 --> 00:07:36.785
We've all been conditioned
to worry about deficits,

00:07:36.827 --> 00:07:40.831
so lawmakers are looking
for ways to spend more

00:07:40.873 --> 00:07:43.125
without adding to the deficit.

00:07:44.335 --> 00:07:46.754
That's what this whole
pay-for game is about.

00:07:48.631 --> 00:07:52.676
Unfortunately, deficits
have gotten a bad rap.

00:07:53.969 --> 00:07:56.889
They're almost always seen
in a negative light.

00:07:58.182 --> 00:07:59.808
And I would like to change that.